{"term":"overweight","senses":[{"id":"kaikki:310ffffe7f78c47943","definition":"Having a higher weight, especially body fat, than what is generally considered healthy for a given body type and height.","example":"Before her diet, Jane was noticeably overweight, but she shed five kilos in the next two months.","pos":"adj","synonyms":["ample","beer-bellied","big","bulky","chubby","chunky","embonpoint","flabby","fleshy","full-figured","fulsome","gorbellied","gorrel-bellied","heavy","heavyset","love-handled","meaty","paunchy","pleasantly plump","plump","plus-size","portly","potbellied","podgy","pudgy","roly-poly","rotund","Rubenesque","sonsy","swagbellied","thick","tubby","well-covered","well-padded","well-rounded","well-upholstered","wide"],"antonyms":["underweight","scrawny","slender","strapping","thin"],"collocations":[],"usage":"","register":"","wordFamily":["overweightness","overweight spaceship"],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/overweight#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"},{"id":"kaikki:38e95f350e44547c31","definition":"Weighing more than what is allowed for safety or legal commerce.","example":"All States allow oversized vehicles if a special permit is obtained, although most States will grant overweight permits only for non-divisible loads.","pos":"adj","synonyms":["fat","morbidly obese","obese","overnourished"],"antonyms":["underweight","scrawny","slender","strapping","thin"],"collocations":[],"usage":"","register":"","wordFamily":["overweightness","overweight spaceship"],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/overweight#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"},{"id":"kaikki:ecbd0f6306116bd059","definition":"Having a portfolio relatively heavily invested in.","example":"Our portfolio is very overweight (in) Asian technology stocks.","pos":"adj","synonyms":["ample","beer-bellied","big","bulky","chubby","chunky","embonpoint","flabby","fleshy","full-figured","fulsome","gorbellied","gorrel-bellied","heavy","heavyset","love-handled","meaty","paunchy","pleasantly plump","plump","plus-size","portly","potbellied","podgy","pudgy","roly-poly","rotund","Rubenesque","sonsy","swagbellied","thick","tubby","well-covered","well-padded","well-rounded","well-upholstered","wide"],"antonyms":["underweight","scrawny","slender","strapping","thin"],"collocations":[],"usage":"","register":"","wordFamily":["overweightness","overweight spaceship"],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/overweight#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"},{"id":"kaikki:33af03bfcb2440edd2","definition":"An excess of weight.","example":"[…] and shall pay not only the amount of the permit fee for overlength, overheight, overwidth or overweight as might be due, but an additional civil penalty of fifty dollars for the first offense, one hundred dollars for the second offense and one hundred fifty dollars for each additional offense; […]","pos":"noun","synonyms":[],"antonyms":["underweight"],"collocations":[],"usage":"","register":"uncountable","wordFamily":["overweightness","overweight spaceship"],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/overweight#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"},{"id":"kaikki:82cd79066862bcc69f","definition":"The condition of being overweight.","example":"SCHOOL MEAL ISSUES FOR CHILDREN AT RISK FOR OVERWEIGHT","pos":"noun","synonyms":[],"antonyms":["underweight"],"collocations":[],"usage":"","register":"uncountable","wordFamily":["overweightness","overweight spaceship"],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/overweight#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"},{"id":"kaikki:e865b027078b7e24c9","definition":"An overweight person.","example":"The study provides up-to-date facts on the variety of diseases, vascular, metabolic, hepatic, and other, which are responsible for the excess mortality of overweights.","pos":"noun","synonyms":["adiposity","obesity"],"antonyms":["underweight"],"collocations":[],"usage":"","register":"countable","wordFamily":["overweightness","overweight spaceship"],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/overweight#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"},{"id":"kaikki:867e053d16553ce1a8","definition":"A security or class of securities in which one has a heavy concentration.","example":"Apple common stock is one of our overweights.","pos":"noun","synonyms":[],"antonyms":["underweight"],"collocations":[],"usage":"","register":"countable","wordFamily":["overweightness","overweight spaceship"],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/overweight#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"},{"id":"kaikki:64bf4e07524cd58498","definition":"To weigh down: to put too heavy a burden on.","example":"Such things are not for us to know. Knowledge is to the strong, and we are weak. Too much wisdom would perchance blind our imperfect sight, and too much strength would make us drunk, and over-weight our feeble reason till it fell and we were drowned in the depths of our own vanity.","pos":"verb","synonyms":[],"antonyms":["underweight"],"collocations":[],"usage":"","register":"transitive","wordFamily":["overweightness","overweight spaceship"],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/overweight#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"},{"id":"kaikki:d43c93a3cfe93469b9","definition":"To place excessive weight or emphasis on; to overestimate the importance of.","example":"We also over-weight such vaine future conjectures, which infant-spirits give us.","pos":"verb","synonyms":[],"antonyms":["underweight"],"collocations":[],"usage":"","register":"transitive","wordFamily":["overweightness","overweight spaceship"],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/overweight#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"}],"pronunciation":{"ipa":"/ˌəʊvəˈweɪt/"},"wordFamily":["overweightness","overweight spaceship"]}